---
import MediaSlot from '../MediaSlot.astro';
import ImportArt from '../art/ImportArt.astro';
import Logo from '../Logo.astro';
---
<section class="section feature" id="import" aria-labelledby="import-title">
	<div class="container split">
		<div class="copy head">
			<p class="eyebrow">07 — Import</p>
			<h2 id="import-title">Switch editors. <span class="muted">Bring your setup.</span></h2>
			<p class="lede">
				One command — <em>Sirius: Import from VS Code, Cursor, or Windsurf</em> — brings your settings,
				keybindings, snippets and extensions over from Visual Studio Code, Cursor, Windsurf (now Devin Desktop) or
				VSCodium. Pick the editor, pick the categories, and Sirius reports what came across.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="demo">
			<MediaSlot name="import" label="The import command in Sirius: choosing the editor to import from, then the categories — settings, keybindings, snippets, extensions."><ImportArt /></MediaSlot>
		</div>
		<div class="copy more">
			<ul class="points">
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>It finds what is installed.</b> Sirius detects which of the four editors have a profile on this machine and offers only those, with the path it will read.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Your choice, category by category.</b> Settings, keybindings, snippets, extensions — all four are ticked by default; untick what should stay behind.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>A report, not a shrug.</b> When it finishes you get the counts, and a Sirius Import output channel with the detail — including anything that is not on Open VSX.</div></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr); grid-template-areas: "head demo" "more demo"; column-gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); row-gap: 1.75rem; align-items: center; }
	.head { grid-area: head; align-self: end; }
	.more { grid-area: more; align-self: start; }
	.demo { grid-area: demo; }
	.copy h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.copy .lede { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: var(--text-m); }
	.points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
	.points li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr; gap: 0.85rem; align-items: start; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: var(--text-s); line-height: 1.55; }
	.points b { color: var(--fg); }
	.points :global(.pt-icon) { margin-top: 0.3em; }
	@media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "head" "demo" "more"; row-gap: 2.25rem; } }
</style>
